<title>UK: GECC sets $250 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets $250 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    13.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.99    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.59     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
